### Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Detailed Health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health/detailed

### Scrape a website
POST http://localhost:4000/api/scrape
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}

### Get specific section
POST http://localhost:4000/api/scrape/section
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "sectionType": "hero"
}

### Generate component
POST http://localhost:4000/api/analyze/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<div class='hero'><h1>Hello World</h1><p>Welcome to our site</p></div>",
  "sectionType": "hero",
  "componentName": "Hero"
}

### Refine component
POST http://localhost:4000/api/analyze/refine
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "export default function Hero() { return <div>Hello</div> }",
  "instruction": "Add a title prop and make the text color blue"
}